Patch 2034: VPULL=1 (opt-in): GPU vertex pulling for indexed tris/strips/fans, ported from the J-Stars vpull + vpull-once patches

Source: the maintainer's other port, toolkit 3598e10.

Guest vertex bytes go into a byte ring and the VS decodes them by SV_VertexID; everything else stays on the CPU path. First fight A/B: 56.8 vs 51.8 median flips, [PERF] vtx 0.06 vs 0.13 s, 100% of indexed draws pulled, 0 not drawn.


